[0.006, "o", "# Platform portfolio — 29 August 2026\r\n\r\n## Executive summary\r\n\r\n- 3 open bugs are in scope; 1 needs an ownership decision before the next review.\r\n- The parser rollout is blocked; QA and documentation are moving.\r\n\r\n## Status view\r\n\r\n| Status | Count | Bugs |\r\n| --- | ---: | --- |\r\n| In progress | 1 | 235 |\r\n| New | 2 | 236, 237 |\r\n\r\n## Needs attention\r\n\r\n- **Bug 235 — Parser rollout:** marked `blocked: owner needed`; assign an owner by Monday.\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "## Current updates\r\n\r\n- **Bug 235:** `blocked: owner needed` (mutable whiteboard snapshot).\r\n- **Bug 236:** `verification underway` (mutable whiteboard snapshot).\r\n- **Bug 237:** `ready for review` (mutable whiteboard snapshot).\r\n\r\n## Decisions and follow-ups\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n- Assign bug 235 before the next review; program manager owns follow-up.\r\n\r\n## Limitations\r\n\r\n- Whiteboard values are current snapshots; comments contain the durable update history.\r\n\r\n## Provenance\r\n"]
